  {"type": "text", "h2": "Your printable quote checklist",
   "html": "<p>Print this or keep it on your phone. The company that checks every box is the one to call back.</p>"
           "<ul class=\"checklist\">"
           "<li>TSSA fuels contractor registration shown and checked on the TSSA lookup</li>"
           "<li>Technician certificates: TSSA gas, licensed refrigeration mechanic, ECRA/ESA electrical</li>"
           "<li>WSIB clearance certificate and liability insurance certificate provided</li>"
           "<li>In-home visit done, with measurements taken for a heat-loss and heat-gain calculation</li>"
           "<li>Written quote with model numbers and efficiency ratings for every piece of equipment</li>"
           "<li>Guaranteed total price and a clear statement of what is and is not in scope</li>"
           "<li>Permits named: ESA notification for electrical, any municipal permit, and who pulls them</li>"
           "<li>Warranty years for parts and labour stated, and who registers it</li>"
           "<li>Rebate eligibility checked, NRCan qualified model confirmed, pre-approval filed before install</li>"
           "<li>Financing rate and term in writing, and no rental agreement unless you asked for one</li>"
           "<li>Old equipment removal and refrigerant recovery included in the price</li>"
           "<li>After-hours service hours and how to reach a real person</li>"
           "</ul>"},
